  "title": "ISic003339. Honorific for the Emperor Tiberius",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Tiberio\"><span data-text=\"Tiberio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">Ti(berio)</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesari\"><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Caesari</span></span> · <span data-text=\"divi\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"divus\">divi</span> · <span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"filius\">f(ilio)</span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">Augusto</span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Publius\"><span data-text=\"Publius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Publius\">P(ublius)</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Clodius\"><span data-text=\"Clodius\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Claudius\">Clodius</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Cai\"><span data-text=\"Cai\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">C(ai)</span></span> · <span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"filius\">f(ilius)</span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Rufus\"><span data-text=\"Rufus\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">Rufus</span></span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Latro\"><span data-text=\"Latro\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"Latro\">Latro</span></span>  <span data-text=\"pecunia\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"pecunia\">p̣(ecunia)</span>  <span data-text=\"sua\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"suus\">ṣ(ua)</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"faciendum\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"facio\">f(aciendum)</span> · <span data-text=\"curavit\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"curo\">c(uravit)</span> · </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Tiberio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">Tiberio</span>  <span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Caesari</span>  <span data-text=\"divi\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"divus\">divi</span>  <span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"filius\">filio</span>  <span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">Augusto</span>  <span data-text=\"Publius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Publius\">Publius</span>  <span data-text=\"Clodius\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Claudius\">Clodius</span>  <span data-text=\"Cai\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">Cai</span>  <span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"filius\">filius</span>  <span data-text=\"Rufus\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">Rufus</span>  <span data-text=\"Latro\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"Latro\">Latro</span>  <span data-text=\"pecunia\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"pecunia\">pecunia</span>  <span data-text=\"sua\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"suus\">sua</span>  <span data-text=\"faciendum\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"facio\">faciendum</span>  <span data-text=\"curavit\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"curo\">curavit</span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Tiberio\"><span data-text=\"Tiberio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">TI</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesari\"><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAESARI</span></span>·<span data-text=\"divi\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"divus\">DIVI</span>·<span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"filius\">F</span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Publius\"><span data-text=\"Publius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Publius\">P</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Clodius\"><span data-text=\"Clodius\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Claudius\">CLODIUS</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Cai\"><span data-text=\"Cai\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">C</span></span>·<span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"filius\">F</span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Rufus\"><span data-text=\"Rufus\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">RUFUS</span></span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Latro\"><span data-text=\"Latro\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"Latro\">LATRO</span></span><span data-text=\"pecunia\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"pecunia\">.</span><span data-text=\"sua\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"suus\">.</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"faciendum\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"facio\">F</span>·<span data-text=\"curavit\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"curo\">C</span>·</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Tiberio\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">TIBERIO</span><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAESARI</span><span data-text=\"divi\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"divus\">DIVI</span><span data-text=\"filio\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"filius\">FILIO</span><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span><span data-text=\"Publius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Publius\">PUBLIUS</span><span data-text=\"Clodius\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Claudius\">CLODIUS</span><span data-text=\"Cai\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"Caius\">CAI</span><span data-text=\"filius\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"filius\">FILIUS</span><span data-text=\"Rufus\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Rufus\">RUFUS</span><span data-text=\"Latro\" data-n=\"100\" data-lemma=\"Latro\">LATRO</span><span data-text=\"pecunia\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"pecunia\">PECUNIA</span><span data-text=\"sua\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"suus\">SUA</span><span data-text=\"faciendum\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"facio\">FACIENDUM</span><span data-text=\"curavit\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"curo\">CURAVIT</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic003339_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J.Prag\" src=\"ISic003339_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003339.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag\" src=\"ISic003339-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003339_leftdetail_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J.Prag\" src=\"ISic003339_leftdetail_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003339_leftdetail.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag\" src=\"ISic003339_leftdetail-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic003339_rightdetail_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J.Prag\" src=\"ISic003339_rightdetail_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003339_rightdetail.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag\" src=\"ISic003339_rightdetail-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>Salinas 1884 reports four fragments and reads the end of line 2 as intact; the fourth fragment appears to be now lost, but the tops of both the reported P and S are still visible. </span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>For Tiberius Caesar, son of the divine Augustus. Publius Clodius Rufus Latro, son of Gaius took care of making this with his own money.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This is the only known inscription from the immediate area of Capo d'Orlando (probably ancient Agathyrnum).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> VIII 708 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002649\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002649</a>  </li><li> Salinas NSA 1884 162-163 = 309-310 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 65 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Spigo 2004 40-42 ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001570\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001570</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Neat v-cut letters, well, but not perfectly spaced and regular, with deep triangular serifs, and deep triangular interpuncts between every word. Long 'I' is elongated.</p> Line 1  42-61  Line 2  41-43  Line 3  15  Interlineation not measured    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
